    //    0x10000) and its rows are the ASM matrix's COLUMNS: an A/B dump shows the
    //    object's +0x00 matrix is the exact transpose of rot9, at Q31 scale (the
    //    live object's row norms are 0.99994..0.99999 x 2^31). So transpose and
    //    shift by 15 (2^31 / 2^16) going in, and the same back out.
    int32_t* const mtx = reinterpret_cast<int32_t*>(reinterpret_cast<void*>(obj));
